---
const cards = [
  {
    eyebrow: 'Amplitude',
    accent: 'var(--accent-red)',
    body:
      'A larger amplitude means taller crests, deeper troughs, or stronger compressions. In a linear medium, it changes the energy carried by the wave much more than the propagation speed.',
    svg: 'amplitude',
  },
  {
    eyebrow: 'Wavelength',
    accent: 'var(--accent-blue)',
    body:
      'The wavelength is the distance between matching points on successive cycles, such as crest to crest or compression to compression. It is one convenient spatial variable for describing the pattern.',
    svg: 'wavelength',
  },
  {
    eyebrow: 'Period',
    accent: '#0f766e',
    body:
      'Starting from the traveling pattern, the period is the time between one crest or compression passing a fixed point and the next one passing that same point. The local medium repeats on that same interval.',
    svg: 'period',
  },
];
---

<section class="not-prose my-10 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-[var(--grid-line)] bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,color-mix(in_srgb,var(--accent-blue)_14%,transparent),transparent_34%),radial-gradient(circle_at_bottom_left,color-mix(in_srgb,var(--accent-red)_12%,transparent),transparent_36%),var(--sim-bg)] shadow-sm">
  <div class="border-b border-[var(--grid-line)] px-6 py-5">
    <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[var(--accent-blue)]">Wave Guide</p>
    <p class="mt-3 mb-0 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-7 text-[color:var(--text-muted)]">
     Many equivalent variable choices exist, but this trio is often the clearest place to start.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-px bg-[var(--grid-line)] lg:grid-cols-3">
    {cards.map((card) => (
      <article class="bg-[var(--bg-primary)] p-5">
        <p class="m-0 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em]" style={`color:${card.accent}`}>
          {card.eyebrow}
        </p>
        <h4 class="mt-3 mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-[color:var(--text-primary)]">{card.title}</h4>
        <p class="mt-0 mb-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[color:var(--text-muted)]">{card.body}</p>

        <div class="rounded-[1.4rem] border border-[var(--grid-line)] bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--sim-bg)_78%,white)] p-4 shadow-sm">
          {card.svg === 'amplitude' && (
            <svg viewBox="0 0 280 140" class="h-auto w-full" role="img" aria-label="Amplitude sketch">
              <line x1="14" x2="266" y1="78" y2="78" stroke="rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.28)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 7" />
              <path d="M 14 78 C 38 78 48 28 74 28 C 98 28 110 128 136 128 C 160 128 172 28 198 28 C 222 28 236 78 266 78" fill="none" stroke="rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.92)" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <line x1="74" x2="74" y1="78" y2="28" stroke="rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.84)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <path d="M 66 36 L 74 28 L 82 36" fill="none" stroke="rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.84)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              <path d="M 66 70 L 74 78 L 82 70" fill="none" stroke="rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.84)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              <text x="80" y="60" fill="rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.9)" font-size="13" font-weight="700">A</text>
            </svg>
          )}

          {card.svg === 'wavelength' && (
            <svg viewBox="0 0 280 140" class="h-auto w-full" role="img" aria-label="Wavelength sketch">
              <path d="M 14 78 C 38 78 48 28 74 28 C 98 28 110 128 136 128 C 160 128 172 28 198 28 C 222 28 236 78 266 78" fill="none" stroke="rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.92)" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <line x1="74" x2="200" y1="18" y2="18" stroke="rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.92)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <path d="M 80 10 L 70 18 L 80 26" fill="none" stroke="rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.92)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              <path d="M 190 10 L 200 18 L 190 26" fill="none" stroke="rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.92)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
              <text x="100" y="10" fill="rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.95)" font-size="13" font-weight="700">wavelength</text>
              <circle cx="74" cy="28" r="5.5" fill="rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.78)" />
              <circle cx="198" cy="28" r="5.5" fill="rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.78)" />
            </svg>
          )}

          {card.svg === 'period' && (
            <svg
              viewBox="0 0 280 140"
              class="h-auto w-full"
              role="img"
              aria-label="Animated period sketch showing a clock measuring the time between successive wave cycles passing a fixed point"
            >
              <defs>
                <clipPath id="period-wave-window">
                  <rect x="18" y="24" width="154" height="92" rx="18" />
                </clipPath>
              </defs>

              <rect x="18" y="24" width="154" height="92" rx="18" fill="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.06)" stroke="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.18)" stroke-width="1.6" />
              <line x1="122" x2="122" y1="28" y2="112" stroke="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.48)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="5 6" />

              <g clip-path="url(#period-wave-window)">
                <line x1="18" x2="172" y1="78" y2="78" stroke="rgba(71, 85, 105, 0.24)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 7" />
                <g>
                  <path
                    d="M -220 78 Q -202 114 -184 78 T -148 78 T -112 78 T -76 78 T -40 78 T -4 78 T 32 78 T 68 78 T 104 78 T 140 78 T 176 78 T 212 78 T 248 78 T 284 78 T 320 78 T 356 78"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.16)"
                    stroke-width="12"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                  />
                  <path
                    d="M -220 78 Q -202 114 -184 78 T -148 78 T -112 78 T -76 78 T -40 78 T -4 78 T 32 78 T 68 78 T 104 78 T 140 78 T 176 78 T 212 78 T 248 78 T 284 78 T 320 78 T 356 78"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.92)"
                    stroke-width="4.8"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                  />
                  <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="translate" from="0 0" to="72 0" dur="3.2s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
                </g>
              </g>

              <circle cx="122" cy="60" r="6" fill="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.92)">
                <animate attributeName="cy" values="60;64.5;78;91.5;96;91.5;78;64.5;60" dur="3.2s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </circle>

              <circle cx="224" cy="70" r="34" fill="rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8)" stroke="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.24)" stroke-width="2.4" />
              <circle cx="224" cy="70" r="24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.12)" stroke-width="1.4" />
              <line x1="224" x2="224" y1="42" y2="48" stroke="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.8)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <line x1="224" x2="224" y1="92" y2="98" stroke="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.8)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <line x1="196" x2="202" y1="70" y2="70" stroke="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.8)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <line x1="246" x2="252" y1="70" y2="70" stroke="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.8)" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" />
              <line x1="224" x2="224" y1="70" y2="48" stroke="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.92)" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round">
                <animateTransform attributeName="transform" type="rotate" from="0 224 70" to="360 224 70" dur="3.2s" repeatCount="indefinite" />
              </line>
              <circle cx="224" cy="70" r="4.5" fill="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.96)" />



              <text x="224" y="18" text-anchor="middle" fill="rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.94)" font-size="13" font-weight="700">clock measures T</text>
            </svg>
          )}
        </div>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>


</section>
